{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04324","headline":"拟古赠陈子昂 · 乔知之","name":"拟古赠陈子昂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惸惸孤形影，悄悄独游心。\n以此从王事，常与子同衾。\n别离三河间，征战二庭深。\n胡天夜雨霜，胡鴈晨南翔。\n节物感离居，同衾违故乡。\n南归日将远，北方尚蓬飘。\n孟秋七月时，相送出外郊。\n海风吹凉木，边声响梢梢。\n勤役千万里，将临五十年。\n心事爲谁道，抽琴歌坐筵。\n一弹再三叹，宾御泪潺湲。\n送君竟此曲，从兹长绝弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔知之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}